  "description": "Logging infrastructure for .NET services. Includes a DispatchProxy middleware and a source generator that produces compile-time, reflection-free logging decorators for any interface marked with [LoggingDecorator].",
  "id": "CoreDesign.Logging",
  "isPrerelease": false,
